  "text": "The days of paying for transcription services like OpenAI's Whisper are over. Nvidia just released Parakeet TDT, a completely free speech recognition model that transcribes an hour of audio in just one second. It works with any audio file, automatically adds punctuation and timestamps, and even handles background noise better than paid options, all while being completely free to use commercially. speech below and I'll send you the simple setup guide.",
